===Etymology===
Named after {{w|Michael Faraday}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Any [[conductive]] surrounding, idealized or practical, used to [[interrupt]] the transmission of [[electromagnetic]] energy or [[electrostatic]] [[discharge]] across it.

